{"Categories":[9],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[38],"Id":38,"TextResource":{"Name":"custodia-de-equipaje","Translations":[{"Text":"Custodia de equipaje","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Custodia de equipaje","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"1","Id":214}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Si desea tomar un descanso antes o después de su vuelo y prefiere despreocuparse de su equipaje, puede utilizar el servicio de custodia donde sus pertenencias serán resguardadas con total seguridad por el tiempo que usted necesite.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>If you want to take a rest before or after your flight and would rather get rid of your luggage, you can use the airport's luggage custody service, where your belongings will be fully protected for as long as you need.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916772","Updated":"1489712587","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/038_custodia-de-equipaje.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/398\/node\/309","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/398\/node\/309","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/038_custodia-de-equipaje.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/38\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/038_custodia-de-equipaje.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/38\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false}